     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap FRDeviceUseLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"en-FRDeviceUseLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcFRDeviceUseLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"StructureDefinition-fr-lm-device-use.html\">Logical model - FR LM Device use</a> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-dispositif-medical.html\">CDA - FR Dispositif medical</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMDeviceUse</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRCDADispositifMedical</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMDeviceUse.header.identifier</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRCDADispositifMedical.id</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMDeviceUse.header.status</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRCDADispositifMedical.statusCode</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMDeviceUse.periodOfUse</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRCDADispositifMedical.effectiveTime</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMDeviceUse.periodOfUse.onsetDate</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRCDADispositifMedical.effectiveTime.low</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMDeviceUse.periodOfUse.endDate</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRCDADispositifMedical.effectiveTime.high</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMDeviceUse.periodOfUse.duration</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRCDADispositifMedical.expectedUseTime</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMDeviceUse.header.performer[x]</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRCDADispositifMedical.performer</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMDeviceUse.device</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRCDADispositifMedical.participant</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMDeviceUse.bodySite</td><td colspan=\"5\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Aucune correspondance explicite de bodySite dans FRCDADispositifMedical.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMDeviceUse.reason[x]:FRLMCondition</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRCDADispositifMedical.entryRelationship:frEnRapportAvecALD</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMDeviceUse.reason[x]:FRLMObservation</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRCDADispositifMedical.entryRelationship:frEnRapportAvecAccidentTravail</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3